,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'The RuleBased Styles conditionally applies styles to vertices and edges based on predefined rules. <br>',
'Whenever an element meets the criteria of a rule, a corresponding legend entry is automatically generated. <br>',
'The plugin comes with a predefined set of rules by default. To customize the appearance of default legends, ',
'users can retrieve the default rule list, modify the desired rule styles, ',
'and then incorporate these updated rules into the Rule Based Styles.',
'</p>',
'For detailed information on our JavaScript API, please refer to the <a href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/database/oracle/property-graph/25.1/pgjsd/index.html" target="_blank">documentation</a>.',
'<br>'))
