,p_plug_display_sequence=>20
,p_plug_new_grid_row=>false
,p_plug_item_display_point=>'ABOVE'
,p_location=>null
,p_plug_source=>'The below example shows how various actions in the graph can be persisted. When the page reloads, all the persisted actions are retrieved from the database and applied back to the graph. Actions include group/ungroup and deleting nodes from graph, et'
